...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
deepseek: DeepSeek Reasoner API { class: ext }
model_chain: ModelChain { class: ours }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
agent: agno Agent { class: ours }
claude_api: Claude API { class: ext }
session: 세션 상태 { class: store }

user -> ui: 키 2개 + 프롬프트 제출
ui -> model_chain: ModelChain 생성
ui -> model_chain: get_deepseek_reasoning() 호출
model_chain -> deepseek: create(system_prompt, prompt)
deepseek -> model_chain: reasoning_content + content
model_chain -> ui: (reasoning, content) 반환
ui -> model_chain: get_claude_response() 호출
model_chain -> agent: run() 호출
agent -> claude_api: 시스템 프롬프트 + message
claude_api -> agent: RunOutput 반환
agent -> model_chain: content 반환
model_chain -> ui: response 문자열 반환
ui -> session: user·assistant 메시지 append
ui -> user: 최종 화면 렌더링
